DAY 29 — FINAL MINI-PENTEST + REPORT

OBJECTIVE:
Perform one complete authorized pentest from start to finish.

WORKFLOW:
Scope → Recon → Enumeration → Vulnerability Assessment → Validation → Evidence → Report

NMAP:
nmap -sn <NETWORK/CIDR>
sudo nmap -p- <TARGET> -oA day29-full
sudo nmap -sC -sV -p <OPEN_PORTS> <TARGET> -oA day29-enum

RECORD:
-IP
-Open ports
-Services/versions
-Interesting attack surface

WEB TESTING:
Burp → HTTP History → Repeater → Compare responses

NETWORK TESTING:
Nmap → Service/version → Vulnerability research → Safe validation

METASPLOIT:
Nmap finding → Search → info → show options → Lab validation

EVIDENCE:
-Finding
-Severity
-Affected asset/endpoint/port
-Description
-Evidence
-Impact
-Remediation

REPORT:
Cover Page → Executive Summary → Scope → Methodology → Findings → Conclusion → Appendices

FINAL RULE:
Only report vulnerabilities you actually confirmed with real lab evidence.

CORE SKILL:
